<node id="1218633" title="Re^3: IF condition with a range" created="2018-07-17 04:42:21" updated="2018-07-17 04:42:21" _doctext_mode="lenient"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="757127">tobyink</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;You're thinking of something like this:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;c&gt;
if ( it is equal ) {
   do something;
}
elsif ( it is equal or close ) {
   do something else;
}
&lt;/c&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But you want:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;c&gt;
if ( it is equal ) {
   do something;
}

if ( it is equal or close ) {
   do something else;
}
&lt;/c&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Or even:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;c&gt;
if ( it is equal or close ) {
   if ( it is equal ) {
      do something;
   }

   do something else;
}
&lt;/c&gt;


